{
  "$schema": "./parity_manifest.schema.json",
  "version": 1,
  "description": "Validator parity contract between the C++ plugin and the vscode-bac TypeScript port. Each entry names a fixture and the diagnostic codes the validator must emit (with exact counts) when run with the named pass set. Both ports load the same fixture and assert the same outcome.",
